{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S03、S09、S11等较短段落，感受信息出现得偏密，细字可能分走一部分听音乐的注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然信息更多，但话语拆分得更短，【】的重点突出，感受又有大小层级和音乐时点控制，实际扫读时不必一次读完所有内容。它也更充分地呈现了人物从不甘、怀念、孤独、动摇到接纳矛盾并继续生活的心理变化，尤其把想念亲近与不愿回去受委屈之间的区别讲得更细。X的完整叙述更顺滑，但部分音乐感受被压缩成概括性短词，人物心理和音乐变化之间的细微联系没有Y充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b1516882-e3f4-4840-b02d-9e2553e321b7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T165245850461Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:54:05.864743+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "65562a3d92d309dcf04cf28b3a469cd0756654758457f804ca3e7fe48765f950", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":